  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue_SO
  _lines:
  - When you click the mirror surface, the reflection responds half a beat slower
    than your movements
  - When you stay still, the reflection slowly forms an eerie smile that doesn't
    match your expression
  - 'the overhead light flickers irregularly, and faint female whispers mix into
    the background. '
